{"root":"ego","ipa":"/ˈɛɡo/","core":"自我，自尊心，指个体对自身价值的意识或心理结构。","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","工作"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ˈɛɡo/","zh":"自我，自负","phrases":[{"t":"ego yang besar","zh":"极强的自尊心"},{"t":"menekan ego","zh":"压抑自我"},{"t":"luka ego","zh":"自尊心受损"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia terlalu mementingkan ego pribadinya dalam diskusi ini.","zh":"他在这次讨论中太过于看重个人的自尊心了。"},{"t":"Kita harus bisa mengesampingkan ego demi kepentingan bersama.","zh":"为了共同利益，我们必须能够放下自我。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"ego","ipa":"/ˈɛɡo/","zh":"自我","phrase":{"t":"ego manusia","zh":"人类的自我"},"example":{"t":"Ego adalah bagian dari kepribadian.","zh":"自我是人格的一部分。"}},{"w":"egois","ipa":"/ɛɡoˈɪs/","zh":"自私的","phrase":{"t":"sikap egois","zh":"自私的态度"},"example":{"t":"Jangan menjadi orang yang egois.","zh":"不要做一个自私的人。"}},{"w":"egoisme","ipa":"/ɛɡoˈɪsmə/","zh":"利己主义，自私","phrase":{"t":"egoisme yang berlebihan","zh":"过度的利己主义"},"example":{"t":"Egoisme dapat merusak hubungan pertemanan.","zh":"利己主义会破坏友谊关系。"}}],"derSlugs":["ego","egois","egoisme"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T02:51:46.039Z","src":"base"}